title = Monster collection
rules = Complete a creature's bestiary to unlock its card. Build a deck of one to three different cards. Every card has 30 health. Strike deals 6–10 damage; guard deals 3 and blocks 6. Both sides act together. Surviving reserves enter next round. Battles end after 100 rounds. Cards and results cannot be traded or redeemed and grant no game rewards.
